{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968720/extras/e248cd64532eac7c3de826c210e4a2be.avif?t=1756767466\" width=1280 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street 42 Demo</strong> gives you a first look into the world of Street 42.<br>In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the <strong>opening mission</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore part of the complex and meet <strong>Nana</strong>, the first AI of Street 42.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience around <strong>8\u201315 minutes of gameplay</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version of <strong>Street 42</strong> will include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All story missions, each featuring unique AIs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full progression systems and unlockable content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates, additional levels, and planned <strong>online Co-Op features</strong> (unlocked once the community reaches 500k players). \ud83d\ude80</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968720/extras/72830afde367e6c59ab9b91aaa0972e9.poster.avif?t=1756767466\" width=780 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968720/extras/72830afde367e6c59ab9b91aaa0972e9.webm?t=1756767466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968720/extras/72830afde367e6c59ab9b91aaa0972e9.mp4?t=1756767466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968720?t=1756767466","backg